{
  "_readme": [
    "Assembly line recipes. Copied to config/mwh/recipes.json on first boot; edit that copy.",
    "Reload without restarting: /mwh admin reload",
    "",
    "Each ingredient line is:  item, count, display, rarity",
    "  item    - the REGISTRY ID. This is the only thing matching uses. Display names are",
    "            player-editable with an anvil and are never trusted.",
    "  count   - how many are consumed.",
    "  display - the Arabic label drawn in the terminal. Cosmetic only.",
    "  rarity  - 1 common .. 5 rarest. Picks the colour of the line. Cosmetic only.",
    "",
    "These ids were read directly out of the lang files inside the jars in D:\\Mlife 1.20.1\\mods,",
    "not guessed. Verify any edit with /mwh admin items - it lists every id in here that is not",
    "in the registry.",
    "",
    "Note: the Skript prototype's 'survivorsarsenal' guesses were wrong for most materials. The",
    "raw crafting components on this server come from nukacraft; cloth, nails, batteries and",
    "electronic scrap come from survival_instinct; planks, rubber and fiber fabric come from",
    "survivorsarsenal."
  ],
